<Layout title="Homes for All" description="We're working Bloomington Homes for All to save 29 units of affordable, publicly-owned housing, and build a tenant cooperative." headline="is working with Homes for All&mdash;an association of tenants fighting to save 29 units of county-owned affordable housing.">

<section>
<h2>Bloomington Homes for All</h2>
<p>If you've ever tried to find a place to live in Bloomington, you know there is an affordable housing crisis. That is why it is shocking that Monroe County is trying to evict and demolish 29 units of affordable, county-owned housing, just to build an addition fully-subsidized hotel for the convention center.</p>
<p>We're working Bloomington Homes for All to push the county to <em>save</em> these affordable apartments and allow the tenants to run them collectively through a land-trust.</p>
<p>Want to support the fight? Come to an <a href="calendar">upcoming Chapter Meeting</a> and learn more!</p>
</section>

